      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求b的值",
          "steps": [
            "$G(t)=\\log(1+t^2+t^2)-2b\\sin t=\\log(1+2t^2)-2b\\sin t$。",
            "$G'(t)=\\dfrac{4t}{1+2t^2}-2b\\cos t$，代入$t=0$：$G'(0)=0-2b=-2b$。",
            "令 $G'(0)=0$：$-2b=0\\Rightarrow b=0$。",
            "验证：当$b=0$，$G(t)=\\log(1+2t^2)$，$G'(t)=4t/(1+2t^2)$，$G'(0)=0$成立。"
          ]
