      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "设分式并求系数",
        "分别积分",
        "代入上下限"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "partial_fraction_integral",
        "template": "计算∫t/((t+2)(t+1))dt从0到1",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求积分值",
          "steps": [
            "设 $\\dfrac{t}{(t+2)(t+1)}=\\dfrac{A}{t+2}+\\dfrac{B}{t+1}$，即 $t=A(t+1)+B(t+2)$。比较系数：$1=A+B$，$0=A+2B$，解得 $B=-1,A=2$。",
            "所以 $\\dfrac{t}{(t+2)(t+1)}=\\dfrac{2}{t+2}-\\dfrac{1}{t+1}$。",
            "积分：$\\int_0^1\\left(\\dfrac{2}{t+2}-\\dfrac{1}{t+1}\\right)dt=\\left[2\\ln(t+2)-\\ln(t+1)\\right]_0^1=(2\\ln3-\\ln2)-(2\\ln2-0)=2\\ln3-3\\ln2$。",
            "数值验证：$2\\ln3\\approx2.197,3\\ln2\\approx2.079$，差约$0.118$，与直接数值积分近似吻合。"
          ]
        }
      ],
