    {
      "text": "设区域 $D'=\\{(x,y)\\mid 0\\le y\\le x^2\\le4\\}$，求 $\\displaystyle\\iint_{D'}\\dfrac{|x|}{(x^2+y+2)^2}dxdy$。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "二重积分",
        "对称性化简",
        "换元积分",
        "部分分式"
      ],
      "question_type": "二重积分综合题",
      "method": [
        "利用对称性化为单侧积分",
        "换元s=x²+y+2",
        "换元t=x²后用部分分式"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "利用x的奇偶对称性化简为单侧2倍积分",
        "对内层y积分换元求出关于x的表达式",
        "对x积分换元为t=x²，再部分分式积分"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "double_integral_symmetric_region",
        "template": "在区域0≤y≤x²≤4上积分|x|/(x²+y+2)²",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 4,
      "estimated_minutes": 15,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "求积分值",
          "steps": [
            "由对称性，$\\iint_{D'}=2\\int_0^2\\int_0^{x^2}\\dfrac{x}{(x^2+y+2)^2}dy\\,dx$（$x$范围为$[-2,2]$，故上限为2）。",
            "换元 $s=x^2+y+2$，内层积分$=x\\left[\\dfrac{1}{x^2+2}-\\dfrac{1}{2x^2+2}\\right]=x\\cdot\\dfrac{2x^2+2-x^2-2}{(x^2+2)(2x^2+2)}=\\dfrac{x^3}{(x^2+2)(2x^2+2)}=\\dfrac{x^3}{2(x^2+2)(x^2+1)}$。",
            "总积分$=2\\int_0^2\\dfrac{x^3}{2(x^2+2)(x^2+1)}dx=\\int_0^2\\dfrac{x^3}{(x^2+2)(x^2+1)}dx$，令 $t=x^2$，$xdx=dt/2$，$x^3dx=t\\,dt/2$，上限$t:0\\to4$：",
            "$=\\int_0^4\\dfrac{t}{(t+2)(t+1)}\\cdot\\dfrac{dt}{2}=\\dfrac12\\int_0^4\\left(\\dfrac{2}{t+2}-\\dfrac{1}{t+1}\\right)dt$（部分分式同上一题方法，验证：$t=A(t+1)+B(t+2)$，$A=2,B=-1$）。",
            "$=\\dfrac12\\left[2\\ln(t+2)-\\ln(t+1)\\right]_0^4=\\dfrac12\\left[(2\\ln6-\\ln5)-(2\\ln2-0)\\right]=\\dfrac12\\left(2\\ln6-\\ln5-2\\ln2\\right)=\\ln6-\\ln2-\\dfrac12\\ln5=\\ln3-\\dfrac12\\ln5$。",
            "最终结果：$\\iint_{D'}\\dfrac{|x|}{(x^2+y+2)^2}dxdy=\\ln3-\\dfrac12\\ln5=\\ln\\dfrac{3}{\\sqrt5}\\approx0.2027$。"
          ]
        }
      ],
